api_examples:
1) POST /v1/deployments: {
  "model_pin": "hash:3f5b1e2..."
}
2) POST /v1/generate: {
  "model_pin": "semver:^2.1.0"
}
3) SDK: client.generate({modelPin: {type: 'composite', selectors: ['semver:^2.0.0', 'tag:stable']}}) => returns {resolved_ref: 'artifact:sha256:...', resolution_path: ['semver:^2.0.0' -> 'artifact:sha256:...'], resolver_version: 'r1'}
